 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? Bear proof containers are key. A cool box on the ground board, or storage boxes in a tree each have their strengths. Keep them off the tent floor altogether, especially after sunset. Bears are curious animals, and one easy trick is always keeping the tent tent. Stay calm and don't eat in the tent. Bear spooked while you' eating could lead to it breaking camp. Always keep a clean fire, and stay at it after burning all the bulbs. You' be fine. Just take basic precautions, and you and the bears will get along well together.",
